        "y0": 0.7093907274603601,
        "x1": 0.8976407468854519,
        "y1": 0.7213598442888094
      },
      "text": "(i) The strictest category prescribes the opt-in mecha-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.08571487142800602,
